[TEXTPRNT
[A METHOD FOR PRINTING OUT TEXT MATERIAL, ENTERED VIA LAP-6.
[THE PROGRAM PRINTS OUT ON THE BUFFERED TELETYPE THE TEXT WHICH HAS BEEN ENTERED.
[ALL END OF LINE CHARACTERS ARE TREATED AS SPACES.
[THE $ SYMBOL IS USED TO INDICATE A NEW PARAGRAPH.
[NO WORD SPLITTING OR HYPHENATION IS PROVIDED.
